# Alokito: Figma frames that show individual people's records — names, photos,
# phone numbers, emails, and in one case date of birth, religion and marital
# status. The data is almost certainly mock, but it reads as real and this repo
# is public, so committing it would publish it regardless of what the site
# renders. Kept locally for reference; never committed.
